DATA LICENCE NOTE

This repository contains no third-party source code. The 71 reference
repositories under research/ are NOT committed - they are cloned on demand by
research/fetch.sh, which pins each to an exact commit in research/MANIFEST.json.

Shipped data carries these obligations, tracked in CREDITS.md:
  - OpenStreetMap extracts        ODbL, attribution required
  - Openverse / Wikimedia images CC per-image, attribution with the cached file
  - OSM tagging schema            ISC
